{
  "name": "Heightened Focus",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Flurry of Blows, Patient Defense, and Step of the Wind gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li><strong>Flurry of Blows.</strong> You can expend 1 Ki Point to use Flurry of Blows and make three Unarmed Strikes with it instead of two.</li><li><strong>Patient Defense.</strong> When you expend a Ki Point to use Patient Defense, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to two rolls of your Martial Arts die.</li><li><strong>Step of the Wind.</strong> When you expend a Ki Point to use Step of the Wind, you can choose a willing creature within 5 feet of yourself that is Large or smaller. You move the creature with you until the end of your turn. The creature's movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks.</li></ul>",
